<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL SCORES.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the best-of-35 frames world snooker championship final (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) beat 1-Stephen Hendry (Scotland) 18-12.</p>
<p>Frame scores (Doherty first):</p>
<p>67-7 5-117 0-106 77-13</p>
<p>78-9 75-51 69-11 0-122</p>
<p>12-76 89-32 62-55 57-43</p>
<p>65-13 85-50 47-74 60-28</p>
<p>23-70 71-24 4-110 86-0</p>
<p>85-16 59-45 0-137 12-75</p>
<p>30-61 0-114 57-61 82-23</p>
<p>69-19 71-49.</p>
</text>
